steps:
  # derives: H7 (C2.1, C1.2, C2.2, C1.3, F1.3, F2.2). A read is not a fence.
  # c1 writes under t1 and is paused past its lifetime; c2 is granted t2 and READS
  # (served, highest_before = t1) but does not write. c1 resumes and writes with its
  # stale token while storage's replies to c1 are dropped (s->c1 down, c1->s up).
